GS Archive — license scope / 许可范围

The MIT License below applies only to the source code written for this
project (for example web_viewer/src, web_viewer/scripts, web_viewer/readmodels,
web_viewer/tools and data_pipeline) and to its documentation, except where that
documentation quotes or reproduces game content.

It does NOT apply to, and grants no rights in:

- game content of THE IDOLM@STER SideM GROWING STARS and data derived from it
  (text, images, audio, video, models, masterdata and the files generated from
  them), whose rights belong to BANDAI NAMCO Entertainment Inc. and the other
  rights holders;
- unofficial translations of that content (see web_viewer/docs/LICENSING_20261103.md);
- third-party components, which keep their own licenses
  (see web_viewer/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt). The Spine Runtimes in particular
  require each developer who integrates them to hold a Spine Editor license.

下面的 MIT 许可只适用于本项目自己写的源代码和文档。游戏内容及由其生成的数据、
同人译文、第三方组件都不在此许可范围内。

